    "baseRefName": "staging",
    "body": "## Summary\nCodeQL (now enabled) flagged js/missing-rate-limiting as 2 high-severity alerts on the API. Add express-rate-limit: a global limiter (120/min) on every route plus a stricter limiter (10/min) on the sensitive DSAR export/erase endpoints. This is the change gate working as intended — the scanner caught a real issue and we fix it through the pipeline.\n\n## Tickets\n| Ticket | Title | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| #31 | Fix CodeQL high-sev: add rate limiting | In Progress |\n\n## Changes\n- app/src/server.ts — import express-rate-limit; global + DSAR-specific rate limiters\n- app/package.json — add express-rate-limit ^7 dependency\n- app/package-lock.json — lockfile update\n\n## Test Plan\n- [x] npm test — typecheck (strict) clean, 10/10 tests pass\n- [x] global limiter applied via app.use before routes; dsarLimiter on export + erase\n- [x] CodeQL re-runs on the PR and should report 0 new alerts",
